<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Order Success</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <h1>Order Successfully Placed</h1>
      <p>Dear {{customerName}},</p>
      <p>Your order for the project "{{projectName}}" has been successfully
        placed. Thank you for choosing our services.</p>
      <p>We have received your request and will start working on it shortly.</p>
      <p>Attached to this message is a document containing additional details
        for your reference.</p>

      <p><strong>Payment Status:</strong> {{payment_status}}</p>
      
      <p>Thank you again for choosing our services. We look forward to working
        with you on this project.</p>

      <p>Best regards,</p>
      <p>{{company_name}}</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>